# Hadal Commons (CIPlay hadal_commons): the chain's air platforms, the plaza, the minutes, house 1 and its air, four
# anglers, the toolmaker's chest, house 2, the last broadcast, the broadcast room chest (the cage key), house 3, Ines
# freed (her bag opens only then), her account, the warden's chest, the doors.
island Hadal Commons
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The City Below
zone surface_buoy
air chain_air1
air chain_air2
zone plaza
expect step 1
read Commons council minutes
expect step 2
zone house_1
air house_1
expect step 3
kill Angler fish
expect step 4
open Toolmaker's chest
wait 3
expect step 5
zone house_2
air house_2
expect step 6
read The last broadcast
expect step 7
open Broadcast room chest
wait 3
expect story cagekey 1
expect step 8
zone house_3
air house_3
expect step 9
open Ines's bag
wait 2
expect step 9
use inescage
expect survivor sunken_ines
open Ines's bag
wait 3
expect step 10
read Ines Marlowe's account
expect step 11
open Door warden's chest
wait 3
expect step 12
zone hc_ridge
expect step 13
zone hc_cave
expect step 14
read Warden's lodge note
expect step 15
read Wagon driver's chit
expect step 16
zone doors
expect done
